-rwxr-xr-x spft-gui
-rwxr-xr-x spft-run
spft-run identical to lib/run.sh
spft-gui identical to lib/gui.sh
kernelfix.sh identical to lib/kernelfix.sh (spft-run reads it in Debian)
kernelfix.so.b64 identical to lib/kernelfix.so.b64
