-- kernel 4.19.127-g8d3429bdb336
kernel-ver: 4.19.127-g8d3429bdb336 - SP Flash Tool v5 may refuse this kernel by mistake (it seems to compare versions as text). spft works around that by itself when it starts the tool
-- kernel 4.19.100
kernel-ver: 4.19.100 - SP Flash Tool v5 may refuse this kernel by mistake (it seems to compare versions as text). spft works around that by itself when it starts the tool
